        $$renderer2.push(`<!----></p> <p>Today, making money online is the new trend; one doesn\u2019t need a physical workspace to earn. The cryptocurrency space is one of the avenues making this possible using the internet and your device.</p> <p>Before embarking on the entrepreneurial world of crypto in Nigeria, it is good to first know the basics. It is one thing to know how to `);
